7. Haba ka jngut ka bneng mynsngi, 

Ba kah pyndum u lyoh khyndew; 
Shaid-shaw ngi kyang ngi larisa, 

“Shit, shit ban syaid u khun bynriew.” 

8. Haba la shoh ka Sngi lyngngai, 

Ha um ngi ialehkai sngewbha ; 
Dohthli, dohtham ngi wad, ngi kem, 
Sha i'ng ngi rah ban ibh tah-ja. 

9. Tang noh ka Sngi, ngi lum ngi lang 

Jynri-jyndub, sha ihg ban leit ; 

Katba ki blang ki laid lapah, 

Narud lynti, sohshiah ngi kheit. 

10. Haba shairong u *Nai-rupa, 

Ngi soh-tyngker ha phyllaw i’ng; 

Ngi shad lymmuh, ngi king mastieh,

Nga bud bad lap ki jingVathuhkhana ; 

Ba mih napoh shyntiir ii sim moina. 

2. Ka Lyngwarku ka shong halor tnat-dieng, 

Ban iathuh ka sat-ka-jew baphicng ; 

Nangta nga wad ka siir sngewthiang, 

Ban wan bad k'it noh khlem kyrliang; 

Ban wad, ban khot shu lap rainia, 

Ka phawar kynnoh ka Hamsai'a. 

3. Miaii-mian suki nang san rangbah, 

Ka riam ka beit hadiih ban kiting 'ticli-bah, 

Ka tieng-ka-ma la nang synshar, 

La shong ha-kut ne sah ha-bar; 

Jinglong kawei ka par na-dong sha-dong, 
Iladuh ban long simpah simsong. 

4 . Katba ka ri ka dang sah lung, 

Dang spch symbai ba bet ba thuiig ; 

Nangta ki lar, ki pait ki khatar skit, 

Jingtip u khun ka ri la dang tohkit ;
